  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electric Mobility Program, Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to mobilize public and private investment to transform the transport sector of the country and develop an electric mobility ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the third phase of Nepal&apos;s electric mobility program, for 2021-22. The phase will build off the progress made under phase I and phase II, with the introduction of extended policy support for government clients and ongoing resource mobilization efforts under the progam.</narrative>
  </description>
